    "object": {
      "Graph": {
        "@Type": "f8a58466",
        "@Value": {
          "Implementation": {
            "@Type": "3b83b776",
            "@Value": {
              "TextDocument": {
                "@Type": "f3878285",
                "@Value": {
                  "TextBlobForSerialisation": "(string)IF contain(cr, content => cell) THEN\n\tcell.cdr := d;\nEND_IF\n",
                  "LineInfoPersistence": "(string)4947ffe0-25aa-4d85-86cd-0648e09bf0c2_Impl_LineIds"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "Interface": {
            "@Type": "a9ed5b7e",
            "@Value": {
              "TextDocument": {
                "@Type": "f3878285",
                "@Value": {
                  "TextBlobForSerialisation": "(string)(*\n================================================================================\nFunction Block Method : ConsHeap.rplacd\n\nPurpose:\n    Replaces the cdr value of a cons cell.\n\nApplication:\n    Call to update the next register linked from a list cell.\n\nOperation:\n    1. Checks cr with contain.\n    2. Writes d to the cell's cdr when cr is valid.\n\nInputs:\n    cr - Register of the cell to update.\n    d - New cdr value.\n\nOutputs:\n    None.\n\nInOut:\n    None.\n\nReturn Value:\n    None.\n\nAssumptions:\n    - cr identifies a cell in this heap.\n\nLimitations:\n    - An invalid register is ignored without an error indication.\n\nDependencies:\n    - ConsHeap.contain.\n\nExample:\n\n    fbConsHeap.rplacd(cr := crCell, d := crNext);\n\nRevision History:\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Date         Version  Author           Description\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    13/11/2026   1.0      CannyIEC         Documented existing behaviour\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n================================================================================\n*)\nMETHOD rplacd\nVAR_INPUT\n\tcr, d : CONS_REG;\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n\tcell : ConsCell;\nEND_VAR\n",
                  "LineInfoPersistence": "(string)4947ffe0-25aa-4d85-86cd-0648e09bf0c2_Decl_LineIds"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TypeInfos": {
        "3b83b776": "{3b83b776-fb25-43b8-99f2-3c507c9143fc}",
        "a9ed5b7e": "{a9ed5b7e-75c5-4651-af16-d2c27e98cb94}",
